index 9a18857..10314cb 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -13,3 +13,50 @@ bun dev
 ```
 
 Open [http://localhost:3000](http://localhost:3000) with your browser to see the result.
+
+
+## Audit candidate: API and payment safety (2026-09-21)
+
+This draft is not a production approval. Configure `THORNODE_URLS` and
+`MIDGARD_URLS` as comma-separated HTTPS bases (one to three each), preferably the
+approved Arkeo gateways. Defaults now follow current THORChain connecting docs:
+Liquify first, then thorchain.network. Different hostnames are not proof of
+independent operators. Set `<CHAIN>_RPC_URLS` (e.g. `ETH_RPC_URLS`) for native EVM
+balance reads. These read handlers have 2.5-second per-provider timeouts, reject
+redirects and cap decoded responses at 2 MiB. Server endpoint settings do not
+replace the separate browser wallet RPC configuration; verify both in staging.
+
+Unavailable balance, price, gas and tracking data returns an error rather than a
+fabricated zero or pending result. Unknown indexed transactions return `unknown`.
+The native balance endpoint does not implement ERC-20 token balances. Token
+metadata uses THORNode pool decimals; it no longer guesses decimals from tickers.
+Halted inbound chains are excluded from gas data. Wallet execution still needs
+fresh halt/vault checks through the SDK and an approved funded acceptance run.
+
+Quotes retain source/destination addresses required by the installed wallet SDK,
+use exact integer conversion, request `liquidity_tolerance_bps`, and show a real
+minimum output. Omitted slippage defaults to 3%; 100% tolerance is rejected. One
+upstream streaming quote produces one route/memo. The confirmation UI rejects
+expired quotes. A passing SDK schema test is not proof of correct live execution
+on every source chain, or of memo/vault authenticity from an untrusted provider.
+
+Maya quote support is not implemented by this local API and is now explicitly
+advertised as disabled. The incomplete memoless assets endpoint returns 501;
+available pools alone do not prove memoless registration support. Neither change
+restricts the generic Arkeo gateway's ability to serve properly provisioned Maya
+REST/RPC/indexer services. `/swap` still returns 501 because the THORChain wallet
+plugin constructs and submits transactions from the quote itself; that SDK path
+must be tested before rollout.
+
+Dependency remediation removed unused `@confio/ics23`, pins protobufjs 7 consumers
+to patched 7.6.6, and overrides the unused npm 9 dependency of Cardano crypto with
+npm 11.19.1, eliminating its bundled vulnerable tar 6. The inspected Cardano
+runtime does not import npm. Local tests, type checking and build pass; hardware
+wallet/Cardano compatibility still needs real integrations. The latest scan
+reports 0 critical, 31 high, 42 moderate and 28 low advisories (101 total). Counts
+are dependency alerts, not demonstrated exploitable paths. Do not describe the
+application as free of vulnerabilities. Node engine warnings remain in some
+wallet packages; agree and test the production runtime with maintainers.
+
+References: https://dev.thorchain.org/concepts/connecting-to-thorchain.html and
+https://dev.thorchain.org/swap-guide/quickstart-guide.html.
